   183	interfaces from 2, 6, 25, and 31. Avenues 4, 19, 21, 32, 34, 35, and 36
   184	contain the campaign's distinct constructive or falsification ideas. Reserve
   185	space to assess an independent construction; a second necessary-chart search
   186	does not automatically provide an independent disproof route.
   187	
   188	Structural exclusions, polynomial reconstruction, and exact collisions are
   189	different deliverables. A solver timeout is neither survival nor exclusion;
   190	a modular unit is a signal; a formal or analytic lift with growing support
   191	does not provide a characteristic-zero polynomial pair.
